Recommends: ${svoya:QmlDepends}, papirus-icon-theme
Description: SOS Shell (Quickshell/QML)
 The SOS desktop shell: bar, launcher, Jackson panel, notifications,
 control center, lock screen, greeter, first-run wizard and on-screen
 displays, installed in /usr/share/svoya/shell and run with
 "quickshell -p /usr/share/svoya/shell".
